{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17207650","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17207650","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1720765001:1":{"text":"어머니? 왜 여기 계세요?","source_cn":"母后？您怎么会在这里？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79699D151634EC73","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1720765002:1":{"text":"하지만 그건 중요하지 않아요! 어머니, 이것 좀 보세요! 제가 해냈어요! 전설 속의 왕실 유물을 모두 찾았어요! 이제 곧 하룻밤 만에 성장할 수 있는 마법을 얻게 될 거예요!","source_cn":"不过这不重要！母后，您看！我做到了！我找到了传说中的四...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x600DB9E185947E9A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1720765003:1":{"text":"진정한 마법은 유물 안에 있지 않단다.","source_cn":"傻孩子，真正的魔法，从来都不在遗物里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA701A041464ED0B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1720765004:1":{"text":"네 손에 들려 있는 것들을 다시 한번 자세히 보렴.","source_cn":"再看一眼你手中握着的这些东西吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51927E0B6D8EB7BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:佩吉":{"text":"페기","source":"佩吉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:王后":{"text":"여왕","source":"王后","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}